What's new in 0.1.94

• AuraSpend now asks Google Play once a day and says so quietly: a line in Settings → About, a dot on the Settings button, and one dismissible strip on Home.
• A download that finished while the app was closed now offers the restart the next time you open it.
• A release marked urgent opens Play's own update screen on launch.
• Updates can also arrive as a notification, on their own channel, which you can turn off.
